  <section class="hub-cat" id="cat-core"><div class="hub-cat-head"><h2>Core Accounting</h2><p class="hub-cat-tag">The flagship monthly engagement.</p><span class="hub-cat-count">1 service</span></div><div class="hub-grid"><a class="hub-card" href="https://www.patronaccounting.com/accounting-services"><div class="hub-card-top"><span class="hub-card-name">Monthly Accounting &amp; Bookkeeping</span><span class="hub-card-price">From ₹2,499/mo</span></div><p class="hub-card-desc">Day-to-day books, ledgers, reconciliation and monthly close, supervised by a CA.</p><span class="hub-card-cta">View service &rarr;</span></a></div></section>
